1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
一百多年前，有人忘了关火
Over a century ago, someone forgot the stove.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
一锅蚝汤，熬成了褐色
A pot of oyster broth cooked down to brown.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
尝一口，鲜得舍不得倒
One taste — too good to throw out.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
蚝油，就这样意外诞生
Oyster sauce was born by accident.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
1888年，广东珠海南水
1888, Nanshui in Guangdong.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
一勺淋下去，青菜发亮
One drizzle — the greens turn glossy.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
炒、拌、蘸，都能提鲜
Stir-fry, toss, dip — it lifts everything.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
从一口小锅，到五大洲
From one small pot to five continents.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
如今卖到一百多个国家
Today it's sold in 100-plus countries.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,900
一次意外，鲜了一百年
One mistake — a century of umami.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,400
你炒青菜，会放蚝油吗？
Do you add oyster sauce to greens?

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,900
下集：开门七件事里的那一味
Next: one of life's seven daily needs.
